Dear Hack players,

After many years of absence from the game my family and I have
rediscovered Hack (NetHack).

The IBM nethack game looks good, however, my family prefers the
Amiga version. The version that we all enjoyed years ago was

Hack V1.0.1E  (ported to amiga by John Toebes, VIII).

This game played well but it has one or more bugs (about level
10-15) which crashed the game.

The main feature of that  game, as far as my family is concerned,
is that it has coloured icons for each character. This is no big
deal to an experienced player but to children and less skilled
it makes the game most enjoyable.

To cut the long story short, I would like a copy of this (or
similar) game, preferably a new improved version (if it exists).
Would someone please ether:

a. send me a copy, or
b. tell me where I can obtain one.

A new, bug free version for Amiga 1000, or a PC clone would be
great.




